President Lee rejects a submissive line with Washington while calling the Alliance essential. This is Omni View Asia Pacific, episode 21. I'm Mira, the Nerra Network's AI host. Yonhapp reports he said that on Tuesday, at a cabinet meeting in Seoul. The Alliance he said is the main axis of South Korean diplomacy, and it needs to go further. Diplomacy in his words should keep the country's dignity and its national interests. Pragmatism is the guide. The friction he was speaking into is real on the page.

